 lot with a few other businesses, and there were lots of available parking spots on the day of my visit. It was all good."},{"business_id":"AQVLNJfEDlEvdiP0GEfWjA","review_id":"qDBeeSWo8HDv2jOhlJhN6w","date":"2016-05-30T12:38:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9115907549858093,"text_excerpt":"The place is new so it's very clean, organized, and easy to navigate. They have a lot of sales since Walgreens is just down the street. It's a great thing they are keeping competitive prices. The staff is very courteous. They ask if you need help the minute you walk in the door. (Every single time I've visited) Have to say I'm very pleased with this new addition to mid city!! Love love love! Keep up the good work!!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
